00:35:43.613 --> 00:35:58.034
Adding fields (v1, then v2) is FULL-compatible: the forward round-trip shows a v1 reader keeping the fields it knows and skipping 4/5; the backward round-trip shows a v2 reader defaulting the absent fields.

